# `engines` in package.json is a warning without this and a refusal with it (RG97). The
# whole point of declaring a Node version is that a wrong one is caught at the door: on
# Node 20 this repository fails inside the undici jsdom bundles with a TypeError naming
# nothing, and in the window test with `WebSocket is not defined` -- two symptoms that
# look unrelated and neither of which mentions the runtime.
engine-strict=true
